Steve shot another TV. Then stomped over and ground his heels into the toes of Rusty\'92s shoes.\
\'93Hey!\'94 Rusty objected. \'93Don\'92t step on my\'97\'93\
\'93Shut up! No one wants to hear about your damn shoes.\'94\
Rusty tossed Valerie\'92s legs off his lap and shot to his feet, spoiling for a fight.\
\'93Boys! Boys! Boys!\'94 Chanta shouted. \'93Is this where we\'92re goin\'92 back to? Biffing over song lyrics?\'94\
A sombre atmosphere descended. All the male Elvi tucked their chins and looked down with shame at their suede shoes.\
Steve pat Chanta on the shoulder. \'93Hey, Great Teacher. It\'92ll be all right. You always come through in a pinch. We can always beat you up again if you need the incentive.\'94\
Chanta shrank away from Steve. \'93Nah, thanks. I appreciate the offer. Just give me the day. Okay?\'94\
They gave the Great Teacher the day. Chanta sat at the beerhall table with a pen and a napkin, stared at the blankness, wrote three words, crossed them out, and shoved the napkin away. The results weren\'92t good.
